Author: peterc04 <pcoy400@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Jun 12 08:15:16 2026 +0000

    hill-climb infra: d-scaled decoder bench-variant build + SG_DEC_PROFILE phase timers (task #13)

    Loop infrastructure for diagnosing/optimizing the L3-TC persistent decoder
    megakernel at its proven d=1024 width, WITHOUT touching the production d=128
    _ops.so or the 33/33 wiring gate.

    DELIVERABLE A — coexisting d-scaled bench-variant build:
      * decoder_layout.cuh now carries BOTH layouts under one include guard, selected
        by the compile flag SG_DEC_BENCH_LAYOUT: UNSET -> d=128 (production, the #else
        branch is byte-identical to the historical header), =1 -> d=1024 (the roofline
        build). Branches are #if/#else so any TU sees exactly one consistent
        (constants, __constant__ table, static-assert) set; production never sees bench.
      * megakernel_codegen.py: _decoder_param_sizes(d) is now parametric, _DEC_BENCH_D
        =1024, _decoder_layout_body(d) factors the per-d block, decoder_layout_header()
        emits both branches. Single source of truth preserved; committed header ==
        `--decoder-layout` output (no drift).
      * tuning/decoder_bench.py: JIT-builds the decoder TC cell TU
        (mega_decoder_real_adamw_tc.cu, already excluded from _ops) as a SEPARATELY
        NAMED extension with its own build dir => ninja incremental rebuild + coexists
        with production _ops in one process. Gates the dead fp32 scalar megakernel OFF
        (-DSG_DEC_SCALAR_MEGAKERNEL=0) for d>=768 (its DecSampleSmem blows the 48KB cap).
        Reports wall/step, steps/s, achieved TF/s vs the bf16 roofline.

    DELIVERABLE B — in-kernel per-phase clock64 timers (diagnosis):
      * fused_decoder_megakernel.cuh: SG_DEC_PROFILE (default OFF, NEVER on the prod
        path => production byte-identical) stamps clock64 at every grid-barrier
        boundary into g_dec_prof_max[8]: P1 fwd/bwd, B0/B1/B2 barrier waits, P2 dW-GEMM,
        P2 grad-assembly, P3 opt tail (max across CTAs = critical path).
      * mega_decoder_real_adamw_tc.cu exposes tc_profile_read + D/DFF/LAYERS/SEQ/VOCAB.

    Production: 33/33 L3-TC green on a fresh _ops rebuild from this tree (wiring_check
    --require-all, exit 0). Instrumentation + bench layout are out of the production
    path (compile-flag gated, default off). Loop runbook: /workspace/.hillclimb_loop.md

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>

